    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Old Woman | \u7121\u8a00\u8001\u5a46 is a psychological horror game set in Japan.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To attend university, the protagonist moved to the countryside.<br>However, after starting to visit a certain public bathhouse, eerie things begin to occur.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A horror game set in Japan</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person walking simulator</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two different endings</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It can be completed in 20 to 40 minutes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Developer\u2019s Note</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was developed solo by a 16-year-old.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Streaming Guidelines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both individuals and organizations may upload and stream videos without permission.<br>If possible, we would appreciate it if you could include a link to the Steam page in the video description.<br>RAYBIS GAMES is not responsible for any damages caused by posting or streaming videos of the game.<br>These guidelines are subject to change without notice.</p>",
